          en: 'Terminal, environment variables, permissions, encoding, basic networking, system processes. For each one, rate your comfort level on a scale of one to five. Items below three are study priorities. Dedicate one week to each weak fundamental: study the concept, practice in the terminal, and solve a real problem using that knowledge. This targeted investment eliminates entire categories of future bugs.',
